# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, whose lists live in the process (command/kept_lists.py): it
# deletes those lists with their scenarios and adds the service over the
# repository (src/todo/service, its scenarios shared as
# postgres-item-lists-service), src/todo/infrastructure/postgres (the fixed
# code, the application's tables and migrations), the migration job
# src/todo/migrate.py, and alembic.ini. No handler changes: they take what they
# need of the item lists as a protocol, which the service has. The base files it
# changes are the composition root and the project's build files.
base library/architecture/python/vp-http-api-in-python.skill/examples-proto
change src/todo/main.py
delete src/todo/command/kept_lists.py
delete src/todo/command/features/kept-lists-in-python.feature
delete src/todo/command/test/kept_lists_steps_test.py
change pyproject.toml
change Makefile
change README.md
